<title>UK: TABLE-Powell Duffryn profits up 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Powell Duffryn profits up 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(pre-exceps) 34.5		  vs  32.4</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 15.3		  vs   7.6 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  17.0		  vs  17.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  25.0		  vs  25.0</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excepts	44.1		  vs  42.2</p>
<p> Pretax			29.8		  vs   4.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   853.8		  vs 906.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 40.5 and 45.0 million stg. Pre-tax profit was up 4.5 percent before exceptionals. An exceptional charge of 14.3 million stg for 1996/97 relates principally to disposals.</p>
<p>Full company name - Powell Duffryn Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
